  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Member Profile</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n                                <li>Profile</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Volunteer Details Section Start -->\n                <section class=\"team-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n                                <div class=\"team-desc\">\n                                    <h1>Ryan Josiah Stewart</h1>\n                                    <p>Ryan Josiah Stewart is a highly accomplished IT professional with a strong educational background and extensive training in various technology disciplines. His passion for information technology is matched only by his commitment to environmental conservation through his role as an IT engineer for the Earth Regenerative Project in Sierra Leone.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Education</strong></h5>\n                                    <ul>\n                                        <li><strong>Bachelor's Degree in Computer Application</strong>:\n                                        Ryan completed his Bachelor's degree in Computer Application at Amity University, where he gained a solid foundation in computer science and programming.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>\n                                        <li><strong>Diploma in Information Technology Management:</strong> Ryan holds a prestigious CCNA certification from Blue Crest College, showcasing his expertise in network administration and Cisco technologies.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <h5><strong>Certification</strong></h5>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA):</strong> He further enhanced his knowledge with a Diploma in Information Technology Management, demonstrating his commitment to IT leadership and management.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Certificate in Information Security:</strong>  His dedication to safeguarding digital assets is evident through his certification in Information Security, emphasizing his commitment to cybersecurity.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Certificate in Information Security:</strong>  His dedication to safeguarding digital assets is evident through his certification in Information Security, emphasizing his commitment to cybersecurity.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <h5><strong>Google Certification</strong></h5>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>System Administration and IT Services: </strong> Ryan has earned Google's recognition for his proficiency in system administration and IT services.</li>\n\n                                        <li><strong>Technical Support Specialist: </strong> His Google Technical Support Specialist certificate highlights his ability to provide top-tier technical assistance.</li>\n\n                                        <li><strong>Google-certified Associate Cloud Engineer: </strong> His expertise in cloud computing and engineering has been acknowledged with Google's Associate Cloud Engineer certification.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Web Development: </strong> Ryan's skills in web development make him a versatile IT professional capable of creating dynamic and user-friendly websites.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Customer Service: </strong> With his background in customer service, Ryan excels in providing exceptional support and assistance to clients and end-users.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <ul>                                   \n                                        <li><strong>Computer Technician: </strong> His technical prowess extends to hardware and software troubleshooting, making him a well-rounded computer technician.</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <h5><strong>Language and Communication</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>Ryan is fluent in English and possesses professional communication skills, enabling him to effectively convey complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Environmental Passion</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>Ryan's dedication to the environment shines through his role as an IT engineer for the Earth Regenerative Project in Sierra Leone. His work in this capacity demonstrates his commitment to leveraging technology to address environmental challenges and promote sustainability.</p>\n                                    \n                                    \n\n                                    \n                                    <h3>Skills</h3>\n                                    <p></p>\n                                    <div class=\"progressbar-wrap\">\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"70%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">Server Management</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\">\n                                                    <div class=\"amet\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"80%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder clearfix\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">Inter-Networking</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"80%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder clearfix\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">System Administration</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"80%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder clearfix\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">{JavaScript, HTML, CSS}</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"80%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder clearfix\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">Cloud Computing</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"85%\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder clearfix\">\n                                                <span class=\"progress-title\">Communication</span>\n                                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                                        <span class=\"percent\"></span>\n                                                    </span>\n                                                </span>\n                                            </h4>\n                                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p>Ryan Josiah Stewart is not only an accomplished IT professional with a wealth of knowledge and certifications but also a passionate advocate for environmental conservation and sustainable practices. His unique combination of skills, education, and commitment to a greener future makes him a valuable asset to any organization or project he engages with.</p>\n                                    <h3>Qualification</h3>\n                                    <p>Ryan Josiah Stewart is a highly qualified IT professional with a Bachelor's degree in Computer Application from Amity University, complemented by a Diploma in Information Technology Management, Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA) certification, and expertise in information security. He possesses a diverse set of skills, including cloud engineering, web development, and computer troubleshooting, coupled with a strong foundation in customer service. Fluent in English, he excels in professional communication and has earned Google certifications in system administration, technical support, and cloud engineering. Ryan's commitment to environmental sustainability is reflected in his role as an IT engineer for the Earth Regenerative Project in Sierra Leone, showcasing his dedication to using technology for a greener future.</p>\n                                    <div class=\"row progess-bar-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"85\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">85%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Team Management</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"70\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                            