                   </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"75\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">75%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Finished Events</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p>\n                                        His journey in the world of information technology has been marked by a relentless pursuit of knowledge and a deep passion for utilizing technology to make a meaningful impact. Each qualification and certification he have earned represents a significant milestone in his quest for excellence. From my foundational education in computer application to specialized certifications in network administration, information security, and cloud engineering, He has honed his skills to be a versatile and proficient IT professional.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-4 order-lg-2 order-1\">\n                                <div class=\"sidebar style2\">\n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget style2\">\n                                        <div class=\"profile-widget\">\n                                            <img src=\"/assets/img/team/single-team-1.jpg\" alt=\"Image\">\n                                            <button id=\"downloadResumeButton\" class=\"btn style1\">Download Resume</button>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget\">\n                                        <div class=\"project-info-item-wrap\">\n                                            <div class=\"project-info-item\">\n                                                <h6>Name:</h6>\n                                               <span>Ryan Josiah Stewart</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"project-info-item\">\n                                                <h6>Email:</h6>\n                                               <span>ryanstewart047@gmail.com</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"project-info-item\">\n                                                <h6>Date Of Birth:</h6>\n                                               <span>Feb 14, 1986</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"project-info-item\">\n                                                <h6>Phone:</h6>\n                                               <a href=\"tel:+9901236578\">+232-33-399391</a>\n                                